{
  "job_B14.41.4_20251003_114316": {
    "text": "Halsung.\nIc halsige \u00fee \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne \u00e6lmihtigan God, \u00fee gesceop heofonas & eor\u00f0an & ealle gesceafta, & \u00feurh \u00fea\nEac ic halsige \u00fee eow \u00feurh \u00fea twelf apostolas, \u00fee \u00feam ecean Gode gecorene w\u00e6ron, & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t\nIc halsige \u00fee eac \u00feurh ealle halignyssa, \u00fee synt on heofonan & on eor\u00f0an, & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne fulluht &\n\u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu na ge\u00feristl\u00e6ce, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu \u00feises husles onbyrige, buton \u00feu si unscyldig \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feinges, \u00fee \u00feu nu\nIc halsige \u00fee eow \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne F\u00e6der & Sunu & \u00fe\u00e6ne halegan Gast & \u00feurh \u00feine eowre cristennysse,\n\u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu na ge\u00feristl\u00e6ce natestohwi to \u00feisum husle to ganne ne fur\u00feon to \u00feisum weofude to\nIc halsige \u00fee nu, mann, \u00feurh getingnysse ures drihnes h\u00e6lendes Cristes & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne dom &\nIc halsige \u00fee \u00feurh F\u00e6der & Sunu & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne halegan Gast & \u00fea halegan \u00ferynnysse, \u00fea\n& \u00feurh \u00fea feower godspelleras Matheus, Marcus, Lucas, Iohannes & \u00feurh \u00fea twelf witigan &\nIc halsige \u00fee \u00feurh \u00fea \u00fery cnihtas, \u00fee d\u00e6ghwamlice beforan Gode standa\u00f0, Sidrac, Misac et\ngyf \u00feu scyldig si , \u00fe\u00e6nne ahnexa \u00feu \u00feine heortan & geandet, swa hw\u00e6tt swa \u00feu \u00fear onwite.\nWe bidda\u00f0 \u00fee, drihten h\u00e6lend Crist, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu sette her on \u00fein tacn swa: gif \u00fees mann scildig si, na si\nDrihten, so\u00f0lice do \u00feu \u00feis to lofe & to wur\u00f0unge \u00feinum \u00feam halegan naman, \u00fe\u00e6t ealle menn\nGewyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t.",
